  "whatsapp_greeting": "Merhaba Hocam \ud83d\udc4b Ben EduTakip Asistan\u0131. Size nas\u0131l yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilirim? \u00d6\u011frenci bilgileri, ders program\u0131, \u00f6demeler, \u00f6devler, zam \u00f6nerileri veya bug\u00fcnk\u00fc ders haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 hakk\u0131nda sorular varsa l\u00fctfen bana bildirin.",
